          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 118911,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir veritabanı tablosunu sorgulamaya başlamadan önce elbette ilk olarak tabloyu oluşturmamız ve tabloya veri eklememiz gerekir.</p><p><code>floor</code> numarası ve <code>company</code> sütunlarını içeren bir <code>Directory</code> tablosu oluşturmaya ilk kez göz atalım.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE Directory (&#xA; floor INTEGER,&#xA; company TEXT&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO Directory (floor, company) VALUES (1, &quot;ACME Inc.&quot;);\"><tables><table name=\"Directory\"><row><header content=\"floor\" /><header content=\"company\" /></row><row><data content=\"1\" /><data content=\"ACME Inc.\" /></row></table></tables></database></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Basic Syntax",
            "id": 118912,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir SQL tablosu oluşturmanın temel söz dizimi her zaman <code>CREATE TABLE</code> anahtar kelimeleriyle, ardından tablo adıyla başlar.</p><p>Şimdi sıra <code>Directory</code> tablosunu oluşturmaya geldi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>CREATE</code>, ardından <code>TABLE</code> ve son olarak <code>Directory</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir SQL tablosu oluşturmanın temel söz dizimi her zaman <code>CREATE TABLE</code> anahtar kelimeleriyle, ardından tablo adıyla başlar.</p><p>Bir tabloyu değiştirmek veya tabloya veri eklemek yerine boş <code>Directory</code> tablosunu oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ALTER\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"INSERT\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"DATABASE\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Directories\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>CREATE</code>, ardından <code>TABLE</code> ve son olarak <code>Directory</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Column Definition",
            "id": 118913,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sonraki adımda, hangi sütunları oluşturmak istediğimizi bildirmemiz gerekiyor. Her sütunun adını, ardından veri türünü ekleriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><data content=\"No result!\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>floor</code>, ardından <code>INTEGER</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Oluşturmak istediğin sütunları bildir. Her sütunun adını ve ardından veri türünü ekle.</p><p>Tam sayılar için <code>INTEGER</code>, metin için <code>TEXT</code> kullan.</p><p>Şirket sütununu metin olarak bırakırken kat sütununa tam sayı türü ver.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"level\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TEXT\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"REAL\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Directory\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>floor</code>, ardından <code>INTEGER</code> ve son olarak <code>company</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Column Definition II",
            "id": 121132,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Geçerli sütun veri türleri arasında <code>INTEGER</code>, <code>REAL</code> (ondalık sayılar için) veya <code>TEXT</code> bulunur. <code>BLOB</code> ya da <code>NULL</code> da kullanabilirsin, ancak burada bunları ele almayacağız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>company</code>, ardından <code>TEXT</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Geçerli sütun veri türleri arasında <code>INTEGER</code>, <code>REAL</code> (ondalık sayılar için) veya <code>TEXT</code> bulunur. <code>BLOB</code> ya da <code>NULL</code> da kullanabilirsin, ancak burada bunları ele almayacağız.</p><p>İkinci sütunda sayı veya eksik değer değil, bir şirket adı depola.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"INTEGER\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"REAL\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"NULL\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>floor</code>, ardından <code>company</code> ve son olarak <code>TEXT</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Inserting Values",
            "id": 120194,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tablo yapısı oluşturulduktan sonra geriye yalnızca birkaç değer eklemek kalıyor. Bu kavramı zaten ele almıştık.</p><p>İstediğimiz zaman istediğimiz kadar değer ekleyebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"INSERT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTO\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", company) \" /><text value=\"VALUES\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Acme Inc.'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"INSERT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTO\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", company) \" /><text value=\"VALUES\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Homeflix'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"104\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Directory\"><row><header content=\"floor\" /><header content=\"company\" /></row><row><data content=\"1\" /><data content=\"Acme Inc.\" /></row><row><data content=\"2\" /><data content=\"Homeflix\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>INSERT</code>, ardından <code>INTO</code> ve son olarak <code>VALUES</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tablo yapısını oluşturduktan sonra daha önce öğrendiğin söz dizimiyle birkaç değer ekle.</p><p>Her şirketi ve katı <code>Directory</code> tablosuna yerleştirmek için satır ekleme ifadesini kullan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"INSERT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTO\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", company) \" /><text value=\"VALUES\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Acme Inc.'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"INSERT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTO\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", company) \" /><text value=\"VALUES\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Homeflix'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"FROM\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"WHERE\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TABLE\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>INSERT</code>, ardından <code>INTO</code>, <code>Directory</code> ve son olarak <code>VALUES</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Seeing a created table",
            "id": 120195,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Eklenen değerlerle birlikte <code>Directory</code> tablosu burada.</p><p>Satır ve sütunların nasıl yapılandırıldığına ve bir tabloda nasıl göründüklerine dikkat et.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE Directory (&#xA; floor INTEGER,&#xA; company TEXT&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO Directory (floor, company) VALUES (1, 'Acme Inc.');&#xA;INSERT INTO Directory (floor, company) VALUES (2, 'Homeflix');\"><tables><table name=\"Directory\"><row><header content=\"floor\" /><header content=\"company\" /></row><row><data content=\"1\" /><data content=\"Acme Inc.\" /></row><row><data content=\"2\" /><data content=\"Homeflix\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"INSERT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTO\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", company) \" /><text value=\"VALUES\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Acme Inc.'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"INSERT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTO\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", company) \" /><text value=\"VALUES\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Homeflix'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Column Definition II - Copy",
            "id": 132699,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hataları önlemek için tablonun yalnızca henüz mevcut değilse oluşturulmasını sağlamak üzere <code>IF NOT EXISTS</code> ekleyebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"IF\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"NOT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"EXISTS\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><data content=\"No result!\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>IF</code>, ardından <code>NOT</code> ve son olarak <code>EXISTS</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tabloyu yalnızca yoksa oluşturmak ve zaten mevcutsa hata vermemek için <code>IF NOT EXISTS</code> ekle.</p><p>Bu ifade yeniden çalıştırıldığında <code>Directory</code> tablosunu tekrar oluşturmaya çalışmaması için tablo adından önceki korumayı tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"IF\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"NOT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"EXISTS\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"WHERE\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"NULL\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"DROP\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Directories\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>IF</code>, ardından <code>NOT</code>, <code>EXISTS</code> ve son olarak <code>Directory</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Basic Syntax",
            "id": 118978,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir SQL tablosu oluşturma sözdizimi her zaman hangi anahtar kelimelerle başlar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>CREATE</code>'in ardından <code>TABLE</code>, onun ardından da tablo adını yaz</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">  Tablo adının ardından <code>TABLE</code> ve ardından <code>CREATE</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>CREATE</code>'in ardından <code>TABLE</code>, onun ardından da tablo adını yaz.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir ifade <code>Directory</code> adlı bir tablo oluşturmak üzere. SQL'in bu tabloyu oluşturmasını hangi başlangıç sağlar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>CREATE TABLE Directory</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>TABLE Directory CREATE</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>INSERT INTO Directory</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>CREATE Directory TABLE</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>CREATE TABLE Directory</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Column Definition",
            "id": 118979,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tablo oluşturma söz dizimin en azından hangi sütun özelliklerini içermelidir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Her sütunun adı ve veri türü</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Her sütunun adı</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Her sütunun adı ve veri türü.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>CREATE TABLE Directory (...)</code> ifadesinde yeni <code>floor</code> sütunu tam sayıları depolamalıdır. Bu sütun için ne bulunmalıdır?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Adı ve veri türü, örneğin <code>floor INTEGER</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca adı, <code>floor</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca veri türü, <code>INTEGER</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Sütuna eklenecek bir değer</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Adı ve veri türü, örneğin <code>floor INTEGER</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Column Data Types",
            "id": 118983,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yaygın sütun veri türlerinden bazıları nelerdir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>INTEGER</code>, <code>REAL</code> ve <code>TEXT</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>BOOLEAN</code>, <code>TRUE</code> ve <code>TEXT</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>INTEGER</code>, <code>REAL</code> ve <code>TEXT</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tam sayılar için <code>INTEGER</code>, ondalık sayılar için <code>REAL</code>, metin için <code>TEXT</code> kullan.</p><p>Sırasıyla şirket adı, tam sayı kat ve ondalık puan tanımlıyorsun. Hangi tür sıralaması doğrudur?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">TEXT, INTEGER, REAL</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">INTEGER, TEXT, REAL</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">TEXT, REAL, INTEGER</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">REAL, INTEGER, TEXT</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">TEXT, INTEGER, REAL öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Basic Syntax",
            "id": 118985,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>Birthdays</code> adlı bir tablo oluşturmak için temel söz dizimini yaz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Birthdays (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" birthday \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><data content=\"No result!\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>CREATE</code>, ardından <code>TABLE</code> ve son olarak <code>Birthdays</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
